<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trials_of_La-Grande-Fosse?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Trials of La-Grande-Fosse (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Trials of La-Grande-Fosse"]}}'>Wuppertal trial</a><span class="noprint" style="font-size:85%; font-style: normal; "><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/La-Grande-Fosse-Prozess" title="de:La-Grande-Fosse-Prozess" class="extiw">de</a><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></span></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trials_of_Waldheim?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Trials of Waldheim (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Trials of Waldheim"]}}'>Waldheim trials</a><span class="noprint" style="font-size:85%; font-style: normal; "><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waldheimer%20Prozesse" title="de:Waldheimer Prozesse" class="extiw">de</a><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></span></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trials_of_Rastatt?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Trials of Rastatt (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Trials of Rastatt"]}}'>Rastatt trials</a><span class="noprint" style="font-size:85%; font-style: normal; "><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rastatter%20Prozesse" title="de:Rastatter Prozesse" class="extiw">de</a><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></span></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trials_of_Curiohaus?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Trials of Curiohaus (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Trials of Curiohaus"]}}'>Curiohaus trials</a><span class="noprint" style="font-size:85%; font-style: normal; "><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Curiohaus-Prozesse" title="de:Curiohaus-Prozesse" class="extiw">de</a><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></span></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trial_of_Weißenburg?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Trial of Weißenburg (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Trial of Weißenburg"]}}'>Weißenburg trial</a><span class="noprint" style="font-size:85%; font-style: normal; "><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Weißenburger%20Pogromprozess" title="de:Weißenburger Pogromprozess" class="extiw">de</a><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></span></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hamburg_Ravensbrück_trials" title="Hamburg Ravensbrück trials">Hamburg Ravensbrück trials</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treblinka_trials" title="Treblinka trials">Treblinka trials</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulm_Einsatzkommando_trial" title="Ulm Einsatzkommando trial">Ulm trial</a></li></ul></li>
<li><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Development_of_the_inner_German_border" title="Development of the inner German border">Division of Germany (1945-49)</a></b>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wanfried_agreement" title="Wanfried agreement">Wanfried Accords</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barber-Lyashchenko_Accords?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Barber-Lyashchenko Accords (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Barber-Lyashchenko Accords"]}}'>Barber-Lyashchenko exchanges</a><span class="noprint" style="font-size:85%; font-style: normal; "><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barber-Ljaschtschenko-Abkommen" title="de:Barber-Ljaschtschenko-Abkommen" class="extiw">de</a><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></span></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Territorial_exchange_in_1945_in_the_Harz?action=edit&amp;redlink=1" title="Territorial exchange in 1945 in the Harz (page does not exist)" class="new" typeof="mw:LocalizedAttrs" data-mw-i18n='{"title":{"lang":"x-page","key":"red-link-title","params":["Territorial exchange in 1945 in the Harz"]}}'>Harz exchanges</a><span class="noprint" style="font-size:85%; font-style: normal; "><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span typeof="mw:Entity">[</span><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gebietstausch%201945%20im%20Harz" title="de:Gebietstausch 1945 im Harz" class="extiw">de</a><span typeof="mw:Entity">]</span></span></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bizone" title="Bizone">Trizone unification</a></li>
